    "en": "What the fish?? Gawr Gura: Quest for Bread is an action-platformer fan game where you jump, spin, and fight through unknown lands to help Gura reunite with her lost bread! Features Roughly 2 hours of content Tight, acrobatic platforming Simple but satisfying combat Unique and challenging boss fights Silly hats Dedicated speedrun mode There are plenty of inside jokes and callbacks to past Hololive streams, but no knowledge of the streamers is needed to enjoy the game!"
